    {
      "name": "Blank",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "inqActor06Trait0",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Inquisitorial Blank has no connection to the warp and curtails access to the immaterium in their immediate area. They win any Opposed Tests to resist a Psychic Power. They are immune to Daemonic Possession and cannot be detected through Psyniscience alone. Most Fellowship Tests are made with Disadvantage.   Tests made to Manifest a Psychic Power that targets their Zone, an individual in their Zone, or made within Short Range of them are made with Disadvantage. Daemons treat their Zone as a Minor Hazard. And individuals connected to a psychic hive mind that start in or enter their Zone must make a Challenging (+0) Discipline (Composure) Test or be Stunned (Minor).</p>"
        },
